(208, 7, 37, NULL, 'student', 'D. TEACHING METHODOLOGY AND EVALUATING TECHNIQUES (PAMAMARAAN NG PAGTUTURO PAGSUSUKAT)', 'Gives at least three quizzes every grading period, written assignments, and recitations.', 'likert', NULL, 1, 19, 1, '2026-09-28 15:55:57', '2026-09-28 15:55:57'),
